# This monorepo keeps environment files next to each app:
#
#   apps/api/.env.example   → copy to apps/api/.env   (server secrets: Mongo, JWT, S3)
#   apps/web/.env.example   → copy to apps/web/.env   (public build-time values only)
#
# Docker Compose needs no .env: it ships local-only defaults. To override the
# compose JWT secret, export JWT_SECRET before `docker compose up`.
#
# Production values never live in files: plain settings come from Terraform
# (ECS task definition) and secrets from AWS Secrets Manager.
JWT_SECRET=
